scenario: NET-WIFI-01
title: Wi-Fi and Ethernet
area: Network
rows: F-NET-01, F-NET-02, F-NET-06
machines: any
needs: person
prereq: A Wi-Fi network you may join and its password.
step: Open Settings, Network.
expect: Ethernet and Wi-Fi are shown with their state, address and speed.
clause: F-NET-06.shown
step: Choose your Wi-Fi network, type the password and press Connect.
expect: The page says connected and shows an address.
clause: F-NET-02.connect
step: Open a web page in the Browser tile.
expect: The page loads.
clause: F-NET-02.internet
step: Plug in an Ethernet cable.
expect: Ethernet shows an address within fifteen seconds and the page still loads.
clause: F-NET-01.cable
